{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the `timetable-helper` Skill to answer this timetable request: CSE-A Monday\n\n- Expect a batch (for example `CSE-A`) and a weekday. If either is missing, ask for it instead of guessing.\n- Run the Skill's lookup script and show the result as a table with Time, Course, Room and Faculty columns.\n- If no rows come back, say there are no classes for that batch and day. Do not invent any.\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2814c1b2-d7c2-417b-aae4-c391bb6f8a5e","uuid":"7353c112-f354-4b95-bf8c-f0670500df05","timestamp":"2026-11-18T08:45:18.713Z","isSynthetic":true}
